{"RukuNumber":332,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":67,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓاْ أَءِذَا كُنَّا تُرَٰبٗا وَءَابَآؤُنَآ أَئِنَّا لَمُخۡرَجُونَ","TajweedText":"وَقَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَءِذَا كُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا تُر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بًا و</tajweed>َءَاب<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓؤُن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَئِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَمُخْرَج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٧</span>","End":"٦٧","PageNumber":383,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":332,"MaqraNumber":153,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":68,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَقَدۡ وُعِدۡنَا هَٰذَا نَحۡنُ وَءَابَآؤُنَا مِن قَبۡلُ إِنۡ هَٰذَآ إِلَّآ أَسَٰطِيرُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","TajweedText":"لَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> وُعِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>نَا هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا نَحْنُ وَءَاب<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓؤُنَا مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لُ إِنْ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَسَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>طِيرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَوَّل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٨</span>","End":"٦٨","PageNumber":383,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":332,"MaqraNumber":153,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":69,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ سِيرُواْ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ فَٱنظُرُواْ كَيۡفَ كَانَ عَٰ